        "TileImage": "$($repository 95fc9e66-0251-42db-a6ce-23dbcabc760d).Image",
        "Description": "Agent 47.\r\rA loose end has emerged.\r\rYears after Janus&apos; &quot;retirement&quot;, a humble bodyguard started noticing some inconsistencies with events of that fateful day. He began discovering missing pieces we believed had been swept up. Hidden diaries. Newspaper clippings. Broken security cameras. \r\rUs. \r\rIf he is able to piece all of these things together, we are done for. Years of hard work, obliterated. \r\rI trust you can nip this in the bud. \r\rGood Luck 47.\r\rI will leave you to prepare.",
